terTitsResidueCollapse.lean#L222-L225","doc":"The dihedral coset structure from `σᵢ ≠ σⱼ` alone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_ij_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_ij_iff","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterTitsResidueCollapse.lean#L215-L218","doc":"**The `m = 2` residue, collapsed.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_ij_of_simple_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_ij_of_simple_ne","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterTitsResidueCollapse.lean#L181-L213","doc":"**Cell faithfulness from simple-distinctness at `m = 2`**: the\ninversion sequence of `[i, j]` is `[σᵢ, σⱼ]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_iji_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_iji_iff","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterTitsResidueCollapse.lean#L173-L177","doc":"**The `m = 3` residue, collapsed**: cell faithfulness is exactly\nsimple-distinctness. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:coxeter-tits-residue-collapse","label":"prop:coxeter-tits-residue-collapse","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/coxeter-tits-residue-collapse.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_iji_of_simple_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isReduced_iji_of_simple_ne","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterTitsResidueCollapse.lean#L101-L171","doc":"**Cell faithfulness from simple-distinctness at `m = 3`**: if\n`σᵢ ≠ σⱼ` then `[i, j, i]` is reduced — the inversion sequence\n`[σⱼ, σᵢσⱼσᵢ, σᵢ]` has pairwise-distinct entries, so the length is at\nleast 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.three_le_length_of_eta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.three_le_length_of_eta","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterTitsResidueCollapse.lean#L75-L95","doc":"Three pairwise-distinct elements with `η = 1` force `ℓ(w) ≥ 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.two_le_length_of_eta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.two_le_length_of_eta","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterTitsResidueCollapse.lean#L55-L73","doc":"Two distinct elements with `η = 1` force `ℓ(w) ≥ 2`: both occur in\nthe inversion sequence of a reduced word for `w`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}